WEBVTT

00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:10,250
Here's a prayer for our children, from every parent's heart.

00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:17,330
She was taught to trust your name, believe the same recited scripture saying the songs.

00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:25,210
She learned the verses, read the stories, prayed the prayer, oh, what went wrong?

00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,210
Was it me?

00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:29,370
Did I not believe?

00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:31,850
Was my faith at you too shaky?

00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:36,350
Were my actions inconsistent with your truth?

00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:41,070
Was I rebellious and it shows now in her life?

00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:49,820
Was it lack of understanding, lack of teaching, lack of faith, lack of fruit?

00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:56,820
Did we do our best but our best was done in flesh that never pleases?

00:00:56,820 --> 00:01:03,760
Did we rely on works that could never win a sitter's soul?

00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:12,680
When we raised a child in Christ, I thought the guarantee was that they'd love you, as

00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:18,090
long as we did our parental role.

00:01:18,090 --> 00:01:26,610
Should I wish to change an instant in the past or to question fleshly acts that could never

00:01:26,610 --> 00:01:28,610
last?

00:01:28,690 --> 00:01:32,930
Should I remember that it's you who saves?

00:01:32,930 --> 00:01:36,330
It's me who just receives.

00:01:36,330 --> 00:01:45,810
Should I pray for gifts of grace for her and hope for us who grieve?

00:01:45,810 --> 00:01:54,770
Should I trust the plan you have contains the pain of unbelief to draw us near your heart

00:01:54,770 --> 00:01:58,010
to see the lost?

00:01:58,010 --> 00:02:08,970
Is it part of the inclusion in the kingdom for my soul to cry for those who will not cannot

00:02:08,970 --> 00:02:19,410
count the cost or let the cry of the aching heart be heard up in the heavens like an incense

00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:23,570
so thick it burns the eyes?

00:02:23,570 --> 00:02:31,950
Or if the prayers of a faithful soul, are glory in the sky, let this request be always

00:02:31,950 --> 00:02:42,580
on my mind, my heart, it burns for our children who turn their backs untruth.

00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:50,220
They run away from reason to follow golden dreams, the world may probe us riches, happiness

00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:54,460
and temporary pride.

00:02:54,460 --> 00:03:01,750
But hear my prayer and gather them a good close to your side.

00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:07,230
Lord, take the hearted heart and bake it soft again.

00:03:07,230 --> 00:03:11,150
Take the unbelief and let it bird with fire.

00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:17,350
You give faith and love and gifts just like their gift out.

00:03:17,350 --> 00:03:26,010
Uncrismacy, Lord, give my daughter the ability to believe.

00:03:26,010 --> 00:03:36,020
Remember me, I'm the lost whose eyes you opened, the lame you did set free.

00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:44,900
Remember me, I'm the leopard now forgiven, the doubter who believes it wasn't I.

00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:54,620
I read from truth so often when you had me on your leash, pull back the reins on the

00:03:54,620 --> 00:04:04,740
lost, do for her just as you did for me, break the chains that bind them, drop the scales

00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:13,780
that blind their eyes, turn back that hidden switch so they may see.

00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:24,060
Lord give our sons and daughters the power to repent, the desire to seek, the hunger to

00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:28,460
know you and the faith to believe.

